WEB SOURCE (the specification — read end to end)
  components/feedback/NewVersionBanner.tsx + its data hook hooks/useVersionWatcher.ts.
    useVersionWatcher : boot-probes GET /system/version once on mount (bootVersion), polls every 5 min
                        (latestVersion), coalesces peer tabs over a `teslasync:version` BroadcastChannel, and
                        SWALLOWS transient poll errors (only a 4xx is console.warn'd; the banner stays silent).
                        newVersionAvailable = !!(bootVersion && latestVersion && latestVersion !== bootVersion).
    NewVersionBanner  : a soft bottom-right toast (role="status", aria-live="polite", max-w-sm) surfaced only
                        when a redeploy is detected. Branches:
                          if (!newVersionAvailable) return null;                              // L50
                          if (latestVersion && dismissedVersion === latestVersion) return null; // L51
                          else render { Sparkles · message · <Button ghost>Later · <Button primary>Reload }
                        handleReload = window.location.reload();
                        handleLater  = sessionStorage['teslasync:new-version-dismissed-for'] = latestVersion;
                        per-version dismissal reset (L43-L48): once latestVersion advances past the dismissed
                        value, the stored dismissal is cleared so the user is nudged again.
    i18n keys (the surface IS internationalised — t(key, default)):
                        app.newVersion.message = "A new version of TeslaSync is available."
                        app.newVersion.later   = "Later"
                        app.newVersion.reload  = "Reload"

